msgid "This website connects to Clockwork Control (operated by Clockwork Web Dev, LLC) for remote site health monitoring, automated backups, and routine maintenance."
msgstr ""

#: src/Support/PrivacyPolicy.php:28
msgid "What Data Is Collected and Transmitted:"
msgstr ""

#: src/Support/PrivacyPolicy.php:29
msgid "When paired, Clockwork Renegade transmits environment telemetry (PHP, WordPress, and server software), plugin and theme inventories, cron health, disk metrics, administrator account names and emails, optional contact-form test results, malware-scan findings, and — when an operator starts a backup — a full database dump plus wp-content files to the AWS S3 bucket configured in Clockwork Control. Clockwork Control may also request a one-time SSO login URL for a named administrator. Nothing is sent until an administrator pastes the Connection Key into Clockwork Control. An optional Sucuri SiteCheck run (administrator-clicked) sends this site's public URL to sitecheck.sucuri.net."
msgstr ""

